api_surface:
- POST /optimize/v1/proposals -> { operation_id } (202 accepted)
- GET /optimize/v1/operations/{op} -> { status, attempts, last_error, traces }
- POST /optimize/v1/operations/{op}/ack -> { acknowledged: true } (for manual ACKs from recipients)
- POST /optimize/v1/operations/{op}/cancel -> { cancelled: true }
- Streaming option for operation status via websockets or SSE for Console integrations.
